==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~30 seconds<sup>400f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 73.33~113.33 seconds<sup>2,200f~3,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 43.33~80 seconds<sup>1,300f~2,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 140 seconds<sup>4,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Wait for Pigge and Hippoe to come near your base. Meanwhile, upgrade the [[Worker Cat]]. Once they are close enough, send out some [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]], [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cats]] and a [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]]. After a short time, Jackie Peng and Gory will appear. Just keep spamming the same units along with [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]]. If you are fast enough, this level can be beaten without having to face Le'boin, Kang Roo and Sir Seal.

If you fail to beat the level fast enough, you'll want to make sure that your Worker Cat is maxed out and that you have enough money to at least spawn a [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]], along with some meatshields and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]] by the time Le'boin appears. If you have a high-level Titan, then Le'boin should die in three hits, making this stage way easier.

If you take too long, a Mooth will spawn. If that happens, spam Macho Cats, Wall Cats, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and Mythical Titan Cats.

