==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Aomori Prefecture'''.
*Aomori Prefecture's base is a reference to [[wikipedia:Aomori Nebuta Matsuri|Aomori Nebuta Matsuri]], a festival in which giant papier-mâché floats depicting historical or mythological warriors are carried down the streets.

